 * ░█░█░█▀█░█░█░█▀▄░█▀█░█▀▄░░░░░░░░░█▀▀░█░░░█▀█░█▀▀░█░█░░░░░░░░░█▄█░█▀█░▀█▀░█░█░█▀▀░█▀▀░█▀█
 * ░█▄█░█▀█░░█░░█▀▄░█▀█░█▀▄░░░▄▄▄░░░█░░░█░░░█░█░█░░░█▀▄░░░▄█▄░░░█░█░█▀█░░█░░█░█░█░█░█▀▀░█░█
 * ░▀░▀░▀░▀░░▀░░▀▀░░▀░▀░▀░▀░░░░░░░░░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀░▀░░░░▀░░░░▀░▀░▀░▀░░▀░░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀▀▀░▀░▀
 */

{
  "clock": {
    "interval": 30, //  The interval in which the information gets polled.

    "format": " {:%I:%M %p}", //  The format, how the date and time should be displayed; see format options here. Split braces like {0:%H}text{0:%M}.
    "format-alt": " {:%A, %B %Od %Y}", //Toggle to this alternative format on click, if specified.

    "tooltip-format": "<tt><small>{calendar}</small></tt>", //  Tooltip on hover. Can also show a list of clocks in other timezones. See below the example using the property tz_list.

    "calendar": {
      "mode": "month", //  Calendar view mode. Possible values: year|month
      "mode-mon-col": 4, //  Relevant for mode=year. Count of months per row
      "weeks-pos": "left", //  The position where week numbers should be displayed. Disabled when is empty. Possible values: left|right

      "format": {
        "months": "<span color='{{ colors.primary.default.hex }}'><b>{}</b></span>", //  Format is applied to months header(January, February,...etc.)
        "days": "<span color='{{ colors.on_surface.default.hex }}'><b>{}</b></span>", //  Format is applied to days
        "weeks": "<span color='{{ colors.secondary.default.hex }}'><b>W{}</b></span>", //  Format is applied to week numbers. When weekday format is not provided then is used default format: '{:%W}' when week starts with Monday, '{:%U}' otherwise
        "weekdays": "<span color='{{ colors.tertiary.default.hex }}'><b>{}</b></span>", //  Format is applied to weeks header(Su,Mo,...etc.)
        "today": "<span color='{{ colors.error.default.hex }}'><b><u>{}</u></b></span>", //  Format is applied to weeks header(Su,Mo,...etc.)
      },
    },

    "actions": {
      "on-click-middle": "shift_reset", //  Switch to current calendar month/year
      "on-click-right": "mode", //  Switch calendar mode between year/month
      "on-scroll-up": "shift_up", //  Switch to the next calendar month/year
      "on-scroll-down": "shift_down", //  Switch to the previous calendar month/year
    },
  },
}
